      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The model classifies strings like '(()())' as balanced or unbalanced.  It learned an unusual right-to-left algorithm: compute (closes - opens) over the SUFFIX at each position.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The model classifies strings like '(()())' as balanced or unbalanced.  It learned an unusual right-to-left algorithm: compute (closes - opens) over the SUFFIX at each position.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6qicatvazccblskrt05u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 282.0,
      "width": 1156.0,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1043665193,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2031403297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sequence is unbalanced iff  elevation[0] != 0  OR  any(elevation < 0).  The exercises reverse-engineer WHICH heads implement this.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sequence is unbalanced iff  elevation[0] != 0  OR  any(elevation < 0).  The exercises reverse-engineer WHICH heads implement this.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
