      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2202  Why the LN linear approximation is safe here",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2202  Why the LN linear approximation is safe here",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ssbjdx0pkovtrpyx8hbb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 6004.0,
      "width": 644.0,
      "height": 15.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1143226861,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1025497025,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LN is  y = ((x - mean) / std) * gamma + beta.  The nonlinearity is the divide-by-std.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LN is  y = ((x - mean) / std) * gamma + beta.  The nonlinearity is the divide-by-std.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cdiwzod05jh2mkv0dszr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 6026.0,
      "width": 532.0,
      "height": 15.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1311357403,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1024862906,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For a fixed input distribution, std is nearly constant across samples.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For a fixed input distribution, std is nearly constant across samples.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gyflq8xpa95g1amra5rb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 6048.0,
      "width": 689.0,
      "height": 15.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 74692995,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1248369040,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So over the model's operating distribution, LN acts like  y = A @ x + b  for some matrix A.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So over the model's operating distribution, LN acts like  y = A @ x + b  for some matrix A.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4sgfdk0q09jrnamz6146",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 6070.0,
      "width": 12.0,
      "height": 15.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2080288210,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 484305099,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jsxfoh9mbuzphd7ndjwt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 6092.0,
      "width": 718.0,
      "height": 15.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1929597131,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 751414199,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sklearn.LinearRegression finds A directly by fitting LN(x) as a function of x on batch samples.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sklearn.LinearRegression finds A directly by fitting LN(x) as a function of x on batch samples.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jy5op9lbsmwpq82k8ryq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
      "y": 6114.0,
      "width": 726.0,
      "height": 15.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 645223268,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1244603252,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At seq_pos=0 for THIS model, R^2 > 0.99.  The fit is safe to use for direction back-propagation.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At seq_pos=0 for THIS model, R^2 > 0.99.  The fit is safe to use for direction back-propagation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wxkk2abkvblpxajmk4x1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.0,
