      "locked": false,
      "text": "Decomposing the residual stream: 10 components",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 27,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Decomposing the residual stream: 10 components",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ubxxq6mf5qafs4h6ssgf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 6436.0,
      "width": 971.0,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1457244077,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1973459062,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The residual just before the final LN is a sum of 10 additive contributions: 1 embed + 6 attn heads + 3 MLPs.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The residual just before the final LN is a sum of 10 additive contributions: 1 embed + 6 attn heads + 3 MLPs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "z2k1ko6xnqxu71sel8mw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.0,
      "y": 6462.0,
      "width": 1182.0,
      "height": 20.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1734195516,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 290210830,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1710000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "By linearity of dot product, each component's contribution decomposes separately.  Histogram per component to find who's responsible.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "By linearity of dot product, each component's contribution decomposes separately.  Histogram per component to find who's responsible.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
